# A powerslide right after a landing links the combo like a manual: kickflip, land, powerslide
# within the landing grace: "Kickflip + FS Powerslide", multiplier 2.
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+left 96
hold slide 208..280
run 380
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + FS Powerslide,multiplier=2} within 255..290
expect no event bail
